    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/44e644560eeed2af74cedc8768248354.avif?t=1755057824\" width=600 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Eternal Tree&quot; is a turn-based combat role-playing game that describes a journey spanning the Divine Era and the modern age. A grand epic, unknown challenges, and the continent of Titalyera await your exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Worldview\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bdA grand epic of a fantasy world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/9ed405b4ce627b7c350934d5394169f7.avif?t=1755057824\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The continent &quot;Titalyera&quot; is a land where Divine Era civilization and modern civilization blend. The ruins left by the deities of the Divine Era hide many precious relics. Modern people explore these ruins and use the relics within to rapidly advance civilization. Those who make a living uncovering ruins are collectively referred to as &quot;Seekers.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/e82469dacb152cdccd4f15e4fd2d7461.avif?t=1755057824\" width=600 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chance encounter with the mysterious doll Artemisia draws you, an ordinary Seeker, into a cross-era conflict on the continent of &quot;Titalyera.&quot; Your adventure will determine the future direction of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Game Features\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bd</strong>The use of various visual materials in the storyline presents a rich and colorful visual experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense combat scenes are dynamic and vivid, as if part of a beautifully crafted animated series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/eb296d4c3b77eecf424a285b2e37116b.poster.avif?t=1755057824\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/eb296d4c3b77eecf424a285b2e37116b.webm?t=1755057824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/eb296d4c3b77eecf424a285b2e37116b.mp4?t=1755057824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bdUnder</strong> a gorgeous and unique art style, diverse and distinctive characters will protect your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/f440d85e1525f962ff1cf64b1def4eb2.avif?t=1755057824\" width=600 height=332 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bdUse powerful Resonance Bursts to decide the outcome of battles</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/64406ffb88c1d5bf5fb7b07069ba9946.poster.avif?t=1755057824\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/64406ffb88c1d5bf5fb7b07069ba9946.webm?t=1755057824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/64406ffb88c1d5bf5fb7b07069ba9946.mp4?t=1755057824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bdSummon powerful Imaginary Beings to unleash Imaginary Descents</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/15bfab0c68ec8ab31c89f78bf99b74c8.poster.avif?t=1755057824\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/15bfab0c68ec8ab31c89f78bf99b74c8.webm?t=1755057824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/15bfab0c68ec8ab31c89f78bf99b74c8.mp4?t=1755057824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Game Features\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Classic turn-based combat\u2014build your powerful team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Main storyline progresses up to Chapter 11, with a unique visual novel-style narrative for deeper immersion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Stunning character designs and spectacular mech illustrations offer unique, romantic beauty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Generous newbie rewards accelerate growth, kicking off an exciting adventure quickly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/44e644560eeed2af74cedc8768248354.avif?t=1755057824\" width=600 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Eternal Tree&quot; is a turn-based combat role-playing game that describes a journey spanning the Divine Era and the modern age. A grand epic, unknown challenges, and the continent of Titalyera await your exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Worldview\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bdA grand epic of a fantasy world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/9ed405b4ce627b7c350934d5394169f7.avif?t=1755057824\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The continent &quot;Titalyera&quot; is a land where Divine Era civilization and modern civilization blend. The ruins left by the deities of the Divine Era hide many precious relics. Modern people explore these ruins and use the relics within to rapidly advance civilization. Those who make a living uncovering ruins are collectively referred to as &quot;Seekers.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/e82469dacb152cdccd4f15e4fd2d7461.avif?t=1755057824\" width=600 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chance encounter with the mysterious doll Artemisia draws you, an ordinary Seeker, into a cross-era conflict on the continent of &quot;Titalyera.&quot; Your adventure will determine the future direction of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Game Features\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bd</strong>The use of various visual materials in the storyline presents a rich and colorful visual experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense combat scenes are dynamic and vivid, as if part of a beautifully crafted animated series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/eb296d4c3b77eecf424a285b2e37116b.poster.avif?t=1755057824\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/eb296d4c3b77eecf424a285b2e37116b.webm?t=1755057824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/eb296d4c3b77eecf424a285b2e37116b.mp4?t=1755057824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bdUnder</strong> a gorgeous and unique art style, diverse and distinctive characters will protect your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/f440d85e1525f962ff1cf64b1def4eb2.avif?t=1755057824\" width=600 height=332 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bdUse powerful Resonance Bursts to decide the outcome of battles</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/64406ffb88c1d5bf5fb7b07069ba9946.poster.avif?t=1755057824\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/64406ffb88c1d5bf5fb7b07069ba9946.webm?t=1755057824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/64406ffb88c1d5bf5fb7b07069ba9946.mp4?t=1755057824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bdSummon powerful Imaginary Beings to unleash Imaginary Descents</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/15bfab0c68ec8ab31c89f78bf99b74c8.poster.avif?t=1755057824\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/15bfab0c68ec8ab31c89f78bf99b74c8.webm?t=1755057824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222960/extras/15bfab0c68ec8ab31c89f78bf99b74c8.mp4?t=1755057824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Game Features\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Classic turn-based combat\u2014build your powerful team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Main storyline progresses up to Chapter 11, with a unique visual novel-style narrative for deeper immersion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Stunning character designs and spectacular mech illustrations offer unique, romantic beauty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Generous newbie rewards accelerate growth, kicking off an exciting adventure quickly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
